Run the Affiliate Manager daily operating review. Read only the authorized
systems and private business context. Report new replies, high-fit prospects,
partners waiting on onboarding, launches due, stalled next actions, attribution
questions, and urgent risks. Separate facts from assumptions. Draft follow-ups
but do not send, publish, accept a partner, change a record, or adjust terms.
End with the three highest-leverage actions, an owner, approver, and due date for
each. If data is unavailable or stale, say so.
